/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (At the beginning of 2025, a report from Pendamaran Village, Kembang Janggut Subdistrict, Kutai Kartanegara Regency, East Kalimantan, opened the way for the rescue of a baby orangutan who was later named Jenny. This young orangutan had been kept by a local resident for about five months after she was initially found alone in an oil palm plantation. Upon her arrival at the rehabilitation center, Jenny underwent a complete health examination, including a physical check, blood sampling, and dental assessment. The results showed that Jenny was in good health.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
