68 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (The caregivers even noted a funny moment: during a forest school session, Jenny quietly approached a friend who was eating papaya and tried to steal it. When the caregiver caught her, Jenny quickly stuffed the entire piece of papaya into her mouth as if hiding the evidence and pretending to be innocent. This behavior made the caregivers laugh, but it also showed that Jenny was beginning to feel safe and confident enough to express herself. From a frightened and traumatized infant, she was now transforming into a brave, active, and quick-learning young orangutan.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
